   "end": 7.2310913738317755,
   "text": "In this video, we'll install OpenCrabs on Ubuntu, from zero to your first chat."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.2310913738317755,
   "end": 9.014263,
   "text": "It takes about five minutes."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.564263,
   "end": 19.252109,
   "text": "You need Ubuntu 24.04 or newer on a 64-bit machine, an internet connection, and a key or subscription from an AI provider."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.802109,
   "end": 24.739796000000002,
   "text": "Open a terminal. On the Ubuntu desktop, press Control, Alt and T."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.689796,
   "end": 31.785057000000002,
   "text": "First, two quick checks. Your CPU type decides which file you download."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.335057,
   "end": 36.52565075471698,
   "text": "x86_64 means you want the amd64 download."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.52565075471698,
   "end": 43.169275,
   "text": "On an ARM machine you'll see aarch64 instead, and you want arm64."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.719274999999996,
   "end": 49.581202,
   "text": "Next, your glibc version. It must be 2.39 or newer."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.131201999999995,
   "end": 54.05234790163934,
   "text": "Here it says 2.39, so we're good. Older than that?"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.05234790163934,
   "end": 59.69879799999999,
   "text": "This download won't run there, so watch the older systems video instead."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.64879799999999,
   "end": 64.27923967441859,
   "text": "Now install three small helpers."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.27923967441859,
   "end": 72.25276599999998,
   "text": "curl downloads files, jq reads the release info, and libgomp is a library OpenCrabs needs to run."
